": false}, "created_at": "2025-07-14T09:49:13Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-14T09:49:13Z", "body": "I would think that this is rather unusual \ud83e\udd14. The way I would approach it in a project would be by wrapping MAVSDK into my own structure and mocking that.\n\nIs there a disadvantage for you in just copying the mock headers you want? It feels like it's probably more practical because then you don't have to rebuild MAVSDK from sources just for copying them...", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/3068694454/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null, "event": "commented", "actor": {"login": "JonasVautherin", "id": 2606672, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI2MDY2NzI=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2606672?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin", "html_url": "https://github.com/JonasVautherin", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/3070974643", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2612#issuecomment-3070974643", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2612", "id": 3070974643, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s63C1qz", "user": {"login": "mattforestyoung", "id": 17462459, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDYyNDU5", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17462459?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/mattforestyoung", "html_url": "https://github.com/mattforestyoung", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mattforestyoung/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mattforestyoung/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mattforestyoung/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mattforestyoung/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mattforestyoung/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mattforestyoung/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mattforestyoung/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mattforestyoung/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mattforestyoung/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2025-07-14T21:00:31Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-14T21:00:31Z", "body": "> The way I would approach it in a project would be by wrapping MAVSDK into my own structure and mocking that.\n\nThat's what I was planning on doing, but then I saw that you've already gone through the effort of creating all those mock classes; it seemed like a shame to not reuse them and save myself some effort.\n\n> Is there a disadvantage for you in just copying the mock headers you want? It feels like it's probably more practical because then you don't have to rebuild MAVSDK from sources just for copying them...\n\nNot really, it just means I have to be careful about updating those headers if I choose to update the MAVSDK version I'm using, in case there is a new change not reflected in the copied mock headers.\n\nI'm happy to run with that solution, I just wanted to make the suggestion in case it was something you saw value in adding.\n", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/3070974643/reactions", "total_count": 1, "+1": 1, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null, "event": "commented", "actor": {"login": "mattforestyoung", "id": 17462459, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDYyNDU5", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17462459?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/mattforestyoung", "html_url": "https://github.com/mattforestyoung", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mattforestyoung/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mattforestyoung/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mattforestyoung/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mattforestyoung/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mattforestyoung/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mattforestyoung/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mattforestyoung/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mattforestyoung/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mattforestyoung/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/3072838410", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2612#issuecomment-3072838410", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2612", "id": 3072838410, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s63J8sK", "user": {"login": "JonasVautherin", "id": 2606672, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI2MDY2NzI=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2606672?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin", "html_url": "https://github.com/JonasVautherin", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2025-07-15T09:16:02Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-15T09:16:02Z", "body": "> I just wanted to make the suggestion in case it was something you saw value in adding.\n\nYeah thanks a lot for asking! The thing is that adding if-branches into the CMakeLists makes it harder to maintain, and it doesn't seem like reusing our mocks is a common thing \ud83d\ude48.", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/3072838410/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null, "event": "commented", "actor": {"login": "JonasVautherin", "id": 2606672, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI2MDY2NzI=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2606672?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin", "html_url": "https://github.com/JonasVautherin", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/followers", "following_url": "https://api.